// A governance policy carries no catalog code.
//
// `cedar_policy` is required: it is the rule the policy is evaluated from,
// and one without it can never match. To stage a policy before it takes
// effect, create it with `enabled: false` and flip it when ready.
//
// The rule is parsed on the way in — a malformed expression is a 400 and
// nothing is written — and the assets it names are derived from it.
